PenglaiCjkOfl.ttf is a SIL Open Font License 1.1 subset of Noto Sans SC
from https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk (Adobe / Google).

The 0.5.5 subset keeps only glyphs needed by Penglai office templates and
PDF tests. Reserved names (Noto / Noto Sans SC) were replaced with
PenglaiCjkOfl as required by the OFL for derivative works.

